{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00134",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 4.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.06,
      "end_seconds": 7.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.28,
      "end_seconds": 13.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "So, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.75,
      "end_seconds": 17.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.51,
      "end_seconds": 22.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "She's been having been getting breathless walking short distances, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.5,
      "end_seconds": 25.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.93,
      "end_seconds": 37.26,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "Well, honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.0,
      "end_seconds": 40.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "What's the pattern, is it there all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.33,
      "end_seconds": 47.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "It's, um... not exactly... well, hard to explain, I mean—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.23,
      "end_seconds": 53.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Let me put it another way: how many times in a typical day or week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.5,
      "end_seconds": 55.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "It happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.61,
      "end_seconds": 60.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, on a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.65,
      "end_seconds": 69.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Well, you know, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.22,
      "end_seconds": 75.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.78,
      "end_seconds": 78.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.66,
      "end_seconds": 86.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Hmm, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 86.54,
      "end_seconds": 91.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, you know, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.03,
      "end_seconds": 96.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I, I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.41,
      "end_seconds": 102.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "So, has there been a feeling that you can't take a deep breath too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.83,
      "end_seconds": 108.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Yes, um, I have. I've also had occasional wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.28,
      "end_seconds": 112.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.55,
      "end_seconds": 117.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Yeah, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 118.1,
      "end_seconds": 119.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.28,
      "end_seconds": 123.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.77,
      "end_seconds": 127.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Well, yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.25,
      "end_seconds": 133.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, night sweats or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.99,
      "end_seconds": 147.19,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Uh, no, no chest pain, no night sweats, no weight loss. I did have tiredness at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.3,
      "end_seconds": 150.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.25,
      "end_seconds": 153.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Um, no fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 155.01,
      "end_seconds": 159.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.13,
      "end_seconds": 166.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.06,
      "end_seconds": 174.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Has there been any coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.76,
      "end_seconds": 178.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No coughing up blood, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.29,
      "end_seconds": 181.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.06,
      "end_seconds": 186.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Right, you know, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 187.58,
      "end_seconds": 196.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 87, BP is 134 over 77, saturation 90 percent. Respiratory rate 23, temperature is 37.4 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.08,
      "end_seconds": 199.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.91,
      "end_seconds": 209.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Just a hernia repair, about five years back. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.68,
      "end_seconds": 213.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.94,
      "end_seconds": 215.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.87,
      "end_seconds": 217.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.6,
      "end_seconds": 219.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.72,
      "end_seconds": 223.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.05,
      "end_seconds": 229.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Telmisartan. I take it 40 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 231.01,
      "end_seconds": 239.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the telmisartan was 80 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.7,
      "end_seconds": 244.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.71,
      "end_seconds": 256.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Yeah, not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I was on amlodipine before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.74,
      "end_seconds": 261.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.39,
      "end_seconds": 268.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, I've got high blood pressure. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.62,
      "end_seconds": 270.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.17,
      "end_seconds": 279.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "I, I have COPD. I kept putting it off, you know, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.11,
      "end_seconds": 284.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.48,
      "end_seconds": 288.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.16,
      "end_seconds": 292.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "So, look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.95,
      "end_seconds": 307.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.1,
      "end_seconds": 310.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.48,
      "end_seconds": 328.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.81,
      "end_seconds": 353.54,
      "duration_seconds": 19.73,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Putting it all together, this looks most like chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up. I'd also keep heart-related breathlessness in mind. It could also be a lung condition, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.07,
      "end_seconds": 357.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.18,
      "end_seconds": 377.23,
      "duration_seconds": 18.05,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been getting breathless walking short distances, moderate, and no weight loss or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.19,
      "end_seconds": 380.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.56,
      "end_seconds": 384.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for chronic breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_6",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 386.38,
      "end_seconds": 390.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.86,
      "end_seconds": 398.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "I'm going to order breathing tests, for chronic breathlessness. Alright, have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.29,
      "end_seconds": 410.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "Well, you know, I had a CT scan of the chest done at another clinic last month. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.65,
      "end_seconds": 431.16,
      "duration_seconds": 19.51,
      "text": "Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.56,
      "end_seconds": 433.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.25,
      "end_seconds": 442.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.32,
      "end_seconds": 448.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I mean, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.17,
      "end_seconds": 455.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 455.76,
      "end_seconds": 460.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "No, you know, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}